# Vernier — Architect Context

This repository is **Vernier**: a personal **React + TypeScript + Vite** component library and interactive showcase (precision instrument / deep ocean steel: navy ink, blue-slate panels, luminous azure accent, day + night modes).

## What this project is

- `src/components/` — reusable UI components (Radix + Tailwind)
- `src/tokens.json` — design tokens (+ documented day/night palettes)
- `src/index.css` — CSS variables for `.dark` / `.light` (Tailwind colors flip via vars)
- `src/showcase/` — catalog vitrine (`npm run dev`, port 5174) with theme toggle
- `mcp/` — MCP server to list/read/install components into other projects
- Distribution: copy components (shadcn-style) or MCP `install_component` — not a published npm package

## What this project is NOT

- Not a Go REST API, not multi-role `APP_ROLE`, not Docker/nginx dual deploy
- Standalone library — no sibling product brands in copy or demos
- Ignore any parent-workspace rules that describe `cmd/api`, `internal/`, migrations, or financial API integrations — they do not apply here

## Conventions

- Portuguese (Brazil) for README and showcase copy unless asked otherwise
- Keep the Vernier visual identity (blue ocean steel); do not rebrand to purple SaaS, cream/terracotta clichés, or warm brass/wood/gold
- Tailwind color **keys** stay (`ink`, `panel`, `brass`, `verdigris`, `rust`, `vellum`) — values come from CSS variables
- Handlers/services/repositories layers do not exist — this is frontend library code only

